WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.093
Open Settings, then Siri and Shortcuts.

00:00:03.943 --> 00:00:07.457
With Plus, you can turn on Allow Siri
roster answers here.

00:00:08.607 --> 00:00:10.838
The examples on this screen are a place to
start.

00:00:11.638 --> 00:00:16.293
Siri reads the shifts or visits you've
saved, so check the plan is up to date
first.

00:00:17.543 --> 00:00:20.799
For visits, client names stay off unless
you choose to say them.

00:00:21.649 --> 00:00:24.369
Addresses, phone numbers and notes aren't
shared with Siri.

00:00:25.569 --> 00:00:29.561
If you ask Siri to record an action, it
waits for your confirmation before saving.

00:00:30.561 --> 00:00:31.737
You can undo from Today.

00:00:32.587 --> 00:00:35.148
Opening Today, Calendar or Import is free.
